# Jenah (جناح)

Jenah is a bilingual Arabic-English nonprofit website focused on youth mental health and wellbeing.

## Technology Stack
- HTML
- CSS and JavaScript (where included)
- GitHub for version control
- Vercel for website deployment

## Running Locally
1. Clone the GitHub repository.
2. Open the project folder.
3. Install Node.js if needed.
4. Run `npm run dev`.
5. Visit http://localhost:3000.

## Deployment
The website will be deployed using Vercel and connected to GitHub for automatic updates.

## Privacy
Do not upload passwords, private API keys, or sensitive user information to the repository.
